'''Logos Circle / Brussels''' met on 3 February 2026 at the Commons Hub in Brussels, Belgium, as a "blitz circle" during the Open Source Village that followed FOSDEM. Sixteen people attended and discussed local issues such as litter, a Brussels mesh network and local currencies. The group agreed to amplify existing local efforts.

