'''Logos Circle / New York City''' met on 1 April 2026 at Merlin's Place in Brooklyn, New York, during NYC Deep Tech Week. Eight people, including the host, discussed local issues including peer-to-peer sharing of information about ICE, abortion access, stores that keep biometric data, and financial access for small businesses. No winnable issue was chosen, and the next Circle depends on finding a new Steward.

